    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="40">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 40</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf man gehadodne man oððe ælðeodigne man ðurh ænig ðingc forræde æt feo oððe æt feore, ðonne sceal him se kingc beon for mæg ⁊ for mundboran, buton he elles oðerne hæbbe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If an attempt is made to deprive in any wise a man in orders or a stranger of either his goods or his life, the king shall act as his kinsman and protector, unless he has some other.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf man gehadodne oððe ælþeodigne þurh ænig þingc forræde æt feo oððe æt feore, þonne sceal him cingc beon for mæg ⁊ for mundboran, butan he elles oðerne (hlaford) hæbbe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
